&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N26 is Europe&#39;s leading digital bank, fully licensed in Germany and active across more than 20 markets. We&#39;re not building another fintech product. We&#39;re building the bank people actually rely on: the account where their salary lands, their bills are paid, and their financial life is managed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That ambition shapes how we build. As we enter a new phase of maturity, our focus is on scalability, robustness, and the kind of operational excellence that earns everyday trust — not just signups. New senior leaders are joining to drive this chapter, and we&#39;re sharpening how we ship and sustain products at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re also expanding into the moments that make a bank indispensable, from mobile connectivity to financial tools designed for families. These aren&#39;t adjacent experiments; they&#39;re part of a deliberate strategy to be embedded in daily life, not just downloaded and forgotten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N26 is looking for a Director of Product to head up our Grow &amp;amp; Engage team. In this role, you will own Onboarding &amp;amp; Identity, Engagement &amp;amp; Product Discovery, Subscriptions, Primary Banking domains and lead a cross-functional team driving real impact across N26 — from user growth strategies, onboarding and identity and customer-facing features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the intersection of Product, Engineering, Marketing and Compliance on one side, and real-world banking challenges on the other. Your mission is to translate user acquisition, onboarding, subscriptions and engagement strategies into scalable, compliant product experiences that create long-term value for N26&#39;s customers. You will be the connective tissue between growth mechanics and business outcomes, ensuring that conversion initiatives and subscription models reach production and deliver tangible top-line results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the Growth &amp;amp; Engagement product roadmap: Lead the strategic vision across user onboarding, identity verification, and subscription features, balancing immediate conversion wins with long-term commercial bets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver on company-wide OKRs: Take full accountability for key growth metrics, including Primary Account Users (PAU), gross profit and customer retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end product delivery: Own the entire product lifecycle for core growth initiatives—from opportunity sizing and A/B experimentation to market launch and continuous iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute flagship commercial initiatives: Partner with Marketing, Compliance, and Engineering to bring high-impact offerings (such as our super tier) to market seamlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge Growth &amp;amp; Compliance: Navigate complex regulatory standards while maintaining top-of-funnel velocity, ensuring every product launch is both fully compliant and frictionless for users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster an experimental culture: Drive a high-rigor, hypothesis-led experimentation framework across your team to optimize conversion funnels and maximize user LTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage senior stakeholder alignment: Act as the strategic connective tissue between Product, Marketing, Risk/Compliance, and executive leadership, ensuring clear communication and shared priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish actionable growth metrics: Define and track KPIs that measure user engagement, funnel efficiency, and bottom-line business value to ensure total accountability for outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of product management experience, with a heavy focus on driving user acquisition, onboarding, engagement, or subscription growth within a scaled consumer app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; business acumen: Proven track record of tying product decisions directly to top-line business metrics (such as RGU, PAU, gross profit, and LTV). You think like a business owner, not just a feature builder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep analytical mastery: Exceptional ability to work with complex data sets, design rigorous A/B experiments, analyze funnel conversion, and ground every product decision in quantitative evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth mechanics expertise: Deep familiarity with core engagement levers, including identity verification, onboarding optimization, retention loops, and subscription packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional leadership: Demonstrated success aligning product strategy with Marketing, Growth, and Compliance teams to execute seamless, high-stakes go-to-market launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory &amp;amp; financial services awareness: Experience operating within banking or regulated environments, balancing aggressive growth targets with strict compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile &amp;amp; iterative execution: Comfortable managing multiple growth workstreams in fast-paced, high-velocity environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication: Proven ability to translate complex growth hypotheses and performance metrics into clear, compelling narratives for executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
