&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Engineering Manager to lead our Cloud Foundations team within Platform Engineering domain, Runtime Platform segment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;The Runtime Platform segment’s mission is to provide intuitive, self-service platforms that empower product and feature engineering teams across the organization to seamlessly build, deploy, run and monitor their business applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As Engineering Manager, you will play a pivotal role in shaping the core architectural bedrock of our technology platform. You will be responsible for guiding a talented group of engineers as they evolve foundational, underlying cloud systems into robust, developer-centric platform products. You will have end-to-end ownership of the team’s scope - spanning strategy, execution, and organizational design - ensuring our cloud account baselines, container orchestration, networking, and secret management scale safely, efficiently, and autonomously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;This role is a unique opportunity to define the future of our cloud ecosystem, directly impacting developer velocity, platform resilience and operational security across the entire company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive Platform Vision and Strategy: Define and execute the long-term roadmap for the Cloud Foundations segment, shifting fundamental cloud capabilities into self-service, developer-friendly products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;Empower Engineering Teams: Enable development teams to autonomously provision infrastructure, manage secrets and deploy workloads securely through well-defined APIs, robust tooling, and automated guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;Own Core Cloud Foundations: Oversee a critical portfolio of core platform capabilities, including AWS cloud management (Account Vending Machine, Access Management, Organisation level setup &amp;amp; Cloud Baseline), Infrastructure as Code frameworks (Terraform) and Privileged Access Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;Lead and Scale People: Build, coach, and retain a high-performing team of engineers specializing in cloud architecture, infrastructure, and platform engineering, promoting a culture of technical excellence, continuous learning, and shared ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;Evolve Operational Maturity: Elevate engineering practices around automation, observability, resiliency, and secure-by-default architecture, balancing rapid developer velocity with strict availability and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Act as a strategic liaison between Engineering, Product, Security and other stakeholders to align priorities, manage dependencies and advocate for platform adoption across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;What you need to be successful&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Background&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;Proven experience leading high-impact platform, cloud infrastructure, SRE or DevOps teams in a complex, scale-up or enterprise environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Deep experience in AWS cloud architecture, automated multi-account management frameworks and cloud networking baselines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;Proven track record of transforming foundational cloud infrastructure into product-led, self-service platform solutions that enhance developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
