&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong ability to work with data, track KPIs, and extract actionable insights to drive strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to translate high-level business goals into actionable partnership initiatives within a local market context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Independent Problem-Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; A highly operational mindset with the ability to proactively diagnose and solve day-to-day issues like tracking discrepancies or conversion funnel blocks.&lt;/li&gt;
