&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;Senior / Mid-level iOS Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to drive the evolution of our payment features within the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;107&quot;&gt;Payments segment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Our Payments Team does the heavy lifting behind money movement—powering seamless transactions across regional and global networks. We believe in building high-performance, rock-solid mobile experiences that make sending and receiving money feel effortless and secure. This is a unique opportunity to own a critical domain of a banking app used by millions, where your code directly impacts how users manage their daily financial lives.&lt;/p&gt;
