&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive engineering excellence&lt;/strong&gt; across the mobile community through active code reviews, tech talks, and contributions to shared core libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
