&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Overseas and maintains optimal function of the organisations internal HR &amp;amp; Financial information services systems, which may include database management, network support, installation, customisation, development, maintenance and upgrades to application, systems and modules&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
