&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Atlassian Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team at N26. This role is designed for an &lt;strong&gt;Atlassian technical expert&lt;/strong&gt; who thrives in a high-growth, evolving FinTech landscape. You won&#39;t just be managing tools; you will be optimizing the way our entire organization collaborates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a professional who enjoys &lt;strong&gt;conceptual ownership&lt;/strong&gt;. At N26, we value &quot;first-principles&quot; thinking—the ability to take high-level business goals and translate them into elegant, scalable technical architectures. If you enjoy a role where you have the autonomy to define the &quot;how&quot; and &quot;why&quot; behind a solution, this is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate Vision into Reality:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a key partner to stakeholders, taking broad business objectives and refining them into sophisticated, high-impact technical solutions within the &lt;strong&gt;Atlassian suite&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Independent Project Life-Cycles:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead initiatives from discovery and requirements gathering through to design, build, and global rollout. You will have full ownership of the delivery process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Ecosystem Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify opportunities to modernize our setup. You will independently detect friction points and propose innovative ways to enhance organizational velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer Advanced Customizations:&lt;/strong&gt; Extend the standard capabilities of Jira and Confluence through &lt;strong&gt;custom scripting (Scriptrunner/Groovy)&lt;/strong&gt; and high-level use of &lt;strong&gt;Atlassian APIs&lt;/strong&gt;. You will build the &quot;glue&quot; that connects our processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect Versatile Workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement custom Jira configurations that are robust enough for a regulated bank but flexible enough for an agile tech company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize advanced reporting and analytics to provide leadership with clear visibility into operational health and project progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a subject matter expert, coaching teams on best practices and ensuring our internal documentation is a &quot;gold standard&quot; resource.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Seniority:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years (minimum 3+) of hands-on experience in &lt;strong&gt;Jira, JSM, and Confluence&lt;/strong&gt; administration within enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conceptual Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable working from high-level briefs and enjoy the process of &quot;discovery&quot;—asking the right questions to build a clear, structured path forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Services Context:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in a &lt;strong&gt;regulated environment&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus, helping you balance innovation with compliance and security standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Technical Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; * &lt;strong&gt;Core:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;JQL, Automations, Atlassian APIs, Assets&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Scriptrunner (Groovy)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; You can navigate conversations with both technical and non-technical stakeholders, ensuring everyone is aligned on the solution. Fluent English is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; in Jira administration, workflow customization, stakeholder management, and best practices for scalable implementation across diverse teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Atlassian Analytics &lt;/strong&gt;or the &lt;strong&gt;Forge framework&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
