&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a German-language Senior Copywriter to join the N26 Creative Studio in Berlin or Barcelona.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
