&lt;li&gt;Manage release cycles of new functionalities according to business&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure smooth running of our technology landscape, supporting users, investigating and addressing issues and if necessary working with the vendors on resolution using our Jira ticketing system&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead implementation projects to introduce new solutions and capabilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and report metrics on our technology activities in support of strategic decision-making initiatives and for ongoing measurement and continual improvement&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data management and data architecture activities to ensure high quality data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
