&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager in the Banking Scalability Platform team, you will be responsible for building and maintaining the infrastructure of N26 that relates to Treasury, Ops and Finance. This function is critical to N26’s ability to not only provide our current functionality but to also offer new financial products in a competitive and scalable manner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
