&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Site Reliability Engineer to join the Data Storage Team within the Platform Engineering Domain.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Platform Engineering&#39;s mission is to provide trusted, performant, and self-service platforms, enabling product teams to build &#39;the bank the world loves to use.&#39; As part of this, this team is responsible for architecting and operating highly scalable, secure and compliant infrastructure solutions that manage our core database offering and data storage capabilities. The ideal candidate is a seasoned SRE, &amp;nbsp;an enthusiastic learner eager to pioneer novel platform solutions and grow with a team that values innovation and mentorship. If your expertise meets curiosity, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
