&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in maintaining cloud-based infrastructure, particularly in AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with operational data storage solutions (e.g., PostgreSQL, AmazonRDS, S3 or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with container technologies (Docker) and orchestration (Kubernetes/EKS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in infrastructure as code (Terraform, CloudFormation, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competence in at least one programming language (Python preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
