&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with networking and security best practices in cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability tools (DataDog, Prometheus, Grafana, OpenTelemetry).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
