&lt;p&gt;You will play a pivotal role in bridging the gap between strategy and execution, helping N26 grow and run better by translating ambitious goals into clear KPIs and tangible results. In this role, you will be part of a high-impact team that acts as a strategic partner to leadership, driving customer value and business growth across our core revenue lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/h2&gt;
